    "title": "Oakland church memorializing homicide victims targeted by vandals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Henry Lee ,\n3 hours ago Vandals desecrated St. Columba Catholic Church in North Oakland, destroying crosses meant to honor the city’s homicide victims. The intruders toppled a religious statue and damaged a memorial dedicated to the victims of the Berkeley balcony collapse. Church officials and parishioners expressed heartbreak over the destruction but offered forgiveness... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
